From c7369ae2f47ff61e965ab6341537cc3932ea6c06 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ArnoldasMk <arnoldas.kanobi@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] gpu/mediatek: take ged/ and gpufreq/ from ALPS
 5e415e059253

Verbatim directory-level import of drivers/gpu/mediatek/ged and
drivers/gpu/mediatek/gpufreq from NothingOSS
android_kernel_device_modules_6.1_nothing_mt6878 commit
5e415e059253ce0d2e61c97108e5f5785d71f06f (MTK ALPS mt6878 history,
2025-02-25; branches mt6878/{Galaga,Galaxian,Tetris}/16b).

The 957dac185efe versions lack six exports present in the GQ5012BF1 stock
modules (ged_gpu_is_heavy, ged_set_apo_wakeup_ns[_nolock],
gpufreq_get_cur_temperature, gpufreq_pdca_polling_ack) and give a
CRC-mismatched gpufreq_register_gpufreq_fp import. The 5e415e059253
versions make ged.ko, mtk_gpufreq_wrapper.ko and mtk_gpufreq_mt6878.ko
byte-identical to stock except the build-id.

No GQ5012BF1-authored code: every line comes from the pinned public commit.
